00:00:29.669 --> 00:00:30.502
(epic music)

00:00:30.502 --> 00:00:31.903
- These things are getting
in the way of everything.

00:00:31.903 --> 00:00:33.093
- I'm so sick of them.

00:00:33.093 --> 00:00:34.493
