00:00:36.404 --> 00:00:38.954
- Grown adults trying
so hard to be relatable.

00:00:38.954 --> 00:00:40.684
- Are fidget spinners supposed
to help you concentrate,

00:00:40.684 --> 00:00:42.146
because it's definitely not working.

00:00:42.146 --> 00:00:43.678
- I'm not even that relaxed.

00:00:43.678 --> 00:00:44.950
- Fidget spinners need to end.

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.230
